step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Evaluate a trimmed mean over the full pool to see if trimming improves over median.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a simple best_single ETS to see if a single strong model beats the robust median.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ETS"}

Thought: Test a robust median over the moderately consistent pool2 to see if it improves on the leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a robust median over the small, diverse pool1 to see if it improves on the leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a best_single strategy with the THETA model to see if a single strong seasonal model can beat the current median leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"THETA"}

Thought: Try a robust deterministic median over the most stable pool (pool3) to see if it improves on the current leader median of full pool.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool3"}

Thought: Test the best single model from the highly correlated group, ONLY_FT_rf, to see if it outperforms the current median leader.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ONLY_FT_rf"}

Thought: Test a robust DTW barycenter over pool2 to see if a more sophisticated aggregation beats the current median baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool2","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using inverse_error on the larger pool2 to see if weighting improves over median and trimmed_mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","models":["THETA","DWT_rf","FT_rf","CWT_catboost","FT_catboost","ONLY_FT_rf"],"weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a trimmed mean on pool4 to see if trimming improves over the weighted w2 result.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool4","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a simple mean over pool4 to see if trimming is necessary.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Test a DTW barycenter over the smaller, more stable pool4 to see if it beats the trimmed mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool4","dba_max_iter":30}

